<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM5.2.9">
<l>uṟaka luṟaka luṟaka loṇcuṭa rāḻiyē caṅkē</l>
<l>yaṟaveṟi nāntaka vāḷē yaḻakiya cārṅkamē taṇṭē</l>
<l>yiṟavu paṭāma lirunta veṇma rulōkapā līrkāḷ</l>
<l>paṟavai yaraiyā vuṟakal paḷḷi yaṟaikkuṟik kōṇmiṉ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Do not sleep! Do not sleep! Do not sleep!</l>
<l>You bright shining disc! Oh conch!</l>
<l rend="indent">Nāndaka sword that strikes in order to cut!</l>
<l rend="indent">Beautiful Sārṅga [bow]! Oh staff!</l>
<l>You protectors of the world and the eight [directions]</l>
<l rend="indent">who are without end!</l>
<l>King of birds! Do not sleep!</l>
<l rend="indent">Guard [His] bedchamber carefully!</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
